ity, Ankara.\",\"url\":\"https://www.timeshighereducation.com/student/best-universities/best-universities-turkey\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"234\",\"title\":\"Boğaziçi University\",\"description\":\"Boğaziçi University has entered the world's top 500 universities for the first time in its history, rising two bands in the Times Higher Education (THE) 2026 ...Faculties · Undergraduate Programs · History of Boğaziçi University · Our university\",\"url\":\"https://bogazici.edu.tr/en\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"235\",\"title\":\"All 51 Universities in Istanbul | Rankings \u0026 Reviews 2025\",\"description\":\"Rankings of universities in Istanbul, Turkey 2025 · Koc University · Istanbul Technical University · Bogazici University · Sabanci University · Istanbul University.\",\"url\":\"https://www.universityguru.com/universities-istanbul\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"236\",\"title\":\"Facts and Figures\",\"description\":\"The university has 7 faculties, 1 school, 16,173 students, 2,393 graduates, 442 full-time faculty, 7 main campuses, and 162 research labs.\",\"url\":\"https://bogazici.edu.tr/en/pages/facts-and-figures/206\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"237\",\"title\":\"Research Labs \u0026 Centers - İTÜ\",\"description\":\"İTÜ has nearly 30 research centers and over 400 labs, including the Artificial Intelligence and Data Science Application and Research Center.\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://www.itu.edu.tr/en/research-centers\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"238\",\"title\":\"Istanbul - The American Research Institute in Turkey\",\"description\":\"The ARIT Istanbul center provides study and meeting spaces, specialized research libraries, and internet access.\",\"url\":\"https://aritweb.org/istanbul/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"239\",\"title\":\"Swedish Research Institute in Istanbul (SRII)\",\"description\":\"The Swedish Research Institute in Istanbul (SRII) was founded in 1962 with the aim of promoting Swedish and Nordic research about Turkey and the Eas