57.pdf\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"245\",\"title\":\"Best Hospitals in Istanbul - ClinicSpots\",\"description\":\"May 28, 2025 · Top 10 Best Hospitals in Istanbul ; 1. Acıbadem Hospitals Group · Oncology, cardiology, neurology, organ transplantation · Operates 22 hospitals ...Overview · Key Factors to Consider While... · Acıbadem Hospitals Group\",\"url\":\"https://www.clinicspots.com/blog/best-hospitals-in-istanbul\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"246\",\"title\":\"Top Hospitals in Turkey - Best Medical Treatment Centers\",\"description\":\"Mar 11, 2024 · 1.Memorial Hospital, Istanbul. Memorial Hospital building · 2. Medipol University Hospital, Istanbul · 3. DentSpa, Istanbul · 4. Denta Global, ...Memorial Hospital · Medipol University Hospital · DentSpa · Turkeyana Clinic\",\"url\":\"https://www.medicaltourismco.com/hospitals-in-turkey/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"247\",\"title\":\"The Ultimate Medical Tourism Turkey Guide 2025 - HayatMed Clinic\",\"description\":\"Oct 15, 2025 · Hospital Accreditation Standards: JCI-accredited hospitals in Istanbul must meet 1,220 measurable standards covering: Patient safety protocols ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.hayatmed.com/blog/plastic-surgeries/medical-tourism-turkey/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"248\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.statista.com/topics/4782/health-care-in-turkey/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"249\",\"title\":\"Turkey's 2024 Health Tourism Data - New Health Media\",\"description\":\"Turkey hosted approximately 2 million health tourists in 2024. This figure represents a significant increase compared to the previous year.\",\"url\":\"https://www.newhealth.media/en/blog/turkeys-2024-health-tourism-data\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"250\",\"title\":\"Healthcare in Turkey in 2025 - Immigrant Invest\",\"description\":\"About 80% of the Turkish citizens' expenses on healthcare are covered by Universal Health Insurance. It is a state-funded national healthcare plan. We have ...\u003c|sepa