to question. All possible means are used to undermine critics.\",\"url\":\"https://rsf.org/en/country-t%25C3%25BCrkiye\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"257\",\"title\":\"Turkey ranks 159th in new press freedom index: RSF - Turkish Minute\",\"description\":\"May 2, 2025 · Turkey has dropped to 159th out of 180 countries in the 2025 World Press Freedom Index, published Friday by Reporters Without Borders (RSF).Missing:  landscape | Show results with:landscape\",\"url\":\"https://www.turkishminute.com/2025/05/02/turkey-ranks-159th-in-new-press-freedom-index-rsf/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"258\",\"title\":\"Turkey | Reuters Institute for the Study of Journalism\",\"description\":\"Jun 17, 2025 · During 2024, Turkish media faced significant legal and governmental pressures, with at least 10 journalists arrested and 57 detained.Missing:  landscape newspapers\",\"url\":\"https://reutersinstitute.politics.ox.ac.uk/digital-news-report/2025/turkey\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"259\",\"title\":\"Turkey: Government silences last critical media outlets - DW\",\"description\":\"Jul 9, 2025 · The non-governmental organization Reporters Without Borders has ranked Turkey 159 out of 180 countries in its global press freedom index 2025.Missing:  landscape | Show results with:landscape\",\"url\":\"https://www.dw.com/en/turkey-government-silences-last-critical-media-outlets/a-73220084\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"260\",\"title\":\"Press Freedom in Turkey: 2024 in Review\",\"description\":\"Feb 23, 2025 · Press freedom in Turkey deteriorated further in 2024, with journalist associations calling it “a lost year” for press freedom.Missing:  landscape | Show results with:landscape\",\"url\":\"https://stockholmcf.org/press-freedom-in-turkey-2024-in-review/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"261\",\"title\":\"List of Foreign Embassies and Consulates in Istanbul\",\"description\":\"There are about 99 diplomatic missions based in the city of Istanbul, including Embassies, Consulates, High Commissions of various countries.\",\"url\":\"https://embassies.net/turkey/istanbul\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"262\",\"title\":\"Embassies and Consulates in Istanbul\",\"description\":\"Embassies and Consulates in Istanbul. There are 103 Embassies, Consulates, and Representative offices listed by country in Istanbul, Turkey.\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://embassies.info/turkey/foreignmissions/istanbul\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"263\",\"title\":\"U.S. Consulate General, Istanbul\",\"description\":\"The US Consulate in Istanbul work as a team to promote relations between the American and Turkish governments and people.ABD Başkonsolosluğu · Sections \u0026 Offices · Solicitations and Contracts for...\",\"url\":\"https://tr.usembassy.gov/istanbul/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"264\",\"title\":\"Overview of Embassies and Consulates in Istanbul and Turkey\",\"description\":\"Consulate – this can be considered as a 'mini embassy', and is mostly located in busy tourist cities (e.g. Istanbul). The head of the consulate is the consul, ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.istanbultrails.com/2009/01/overview-of-embassies-and-consulates-in-istanbul-and-turkey/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"265\",\"title\":\"From Istanbul To Influence: Strategic Implications Of Russia ...\",\"description\":\"Sep 4, 2025 · Turkey hosted the encounter with significant diplomatic weight, focusing on limited ceasefire corridors, the exchange of prisoners, and grain ...\u003c|separator|\u003e\",\"url\":\"https://www.eurasiareview.com/04092025-from-istanbul-to-influence-strategic-implications-of-russia-ukraine-talks-and-eurasias-diplomatic-rebalancing-analysis/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"266\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://trendsresearch.org/insight/the-istanbul-process-turkiyes-mediation-in-the-russia-ukraine-war/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"267\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.hurriyetdailynews.com/istanbul-to-host-pakistan-afghanistan-talks-214